(5325,194,194,70910,0,39605,'Horde War Wolf','How many Alliance heads have fallen into the dust by your hand? How many Victories won, enemies crushed, battefields(sic) taken?$b$bThe eyes of Hellscream have been upon you, and they are pleased. Ride on proudly, for the Horde!$b$b--Warchief Garrosh Hellscream'),
(5326,259,259,70910,0,39605,'Horde War Wolf','How many Alliance heads have fallen into the dust by your hand? How many Victories won, enemies crushed, battefields(sic) taken?$b$bThe eyes of Hellscream have been upon you, and they are pleased. Ride on proudly, for the Horde!$b$b--Warchief Garrosh Hellscream'),
(5328,193,193,70909,0,29611,'Alliance War Steed','Time and again your skill and bravery have been proven on the field of battle.$b$bYour deeds will not go unrewarded. Ride on proudly, for the Alliance!$b$b--Your King'),
