(5823,0,0,70909,0,29611,'Alliance War Steed','Time and again your skill and bravery have been proven on the field of battle.$b$bYour deeds will not go unrewarded. Ride on proudly, for the Alliance!$b$b--Your King'),
(5824,0,0,70910,0,39605,'Horde War Wolf','How many Alliance heads have fallen into the dust by your hand? How many Victories won, enemies crushed, battefields(sic) taken?$b$bThe eyes of Hellscream have been upon you, and they are pleased. Ride on proudly, for the Horde!$b$b--Warchief Garrosh Hellscream'),
(5875,0,0,54810,0,28951,'Keep Collecting!','Hello!$b$bWow, you\'re becoming quite the collector of cute critters, aren\'t you?$b$bI thought I\'d write a small note and send a small gift to encourage your efforts. Keep it up!$b$b--Breanni'),
(5876,0,0,71140,0,28951,'I\'m Going Nuts!','Hello again. Friend!$b$bThis mischievous little fellow is driving everyone in the pet store nuts!$b$bI thought you might take him along on some of your adventures... Perhaps he\'ll calm down after he\'s seen a bit of the world.$b$bYou DO wear a helmet, right... ?$b$b--Breanni'),
(5877,0,0,71387,0,28951,'Keep Collecting!','Hello!$b$bWow, you\'re becoming quite the collector of cute critters, aren\'t you?$b$bI thought I\'d write a small note and send a small gift to encourage your efforts. Keep it up!$b$b--Breanni'),
(6716,0,0,83076,0,61962,'Secrets of the Saurok','Greetings $n,$b$bI hear you have learned much of the dreaded saurok. There is much more to this ancient foe than meets the eye. Please join us at the Seat of Knowledge so that we may compare our notes together!$b$bIncluded should be a map to our location. I look forward to our next meeting.$b$bSincerely,$bLorewalker Cho'),
(6754,0,0,83772,0,61962,'The History of Mogu','Greetings $n,$b$bI hear your studies of the ancient mogu are progressing well. We can learn much from the greatness of their ancient empire, as well as the swiftness of tis fall. Come join us at the Seat of Knowledge and I will share with you some additional perspective on our old foe.$b$bIncluded should be a map to our location. I look forward to our next meeting.$b$bSincerely,$bLorewalker Cho'),
(6827,0,0,81559,0,61962,'Pandaren Ambassador','Hello Traveler!$b$bIt has been a long time since we have seen one so devoted to our local Pandaren factions. You have put in many days of hard work to reach this lofty goal.$b$bTake this token of our appreciation, and know that you are welcome in Pandaria at all times.$b$b--Lorewalker Cho'),
(6828,0,0,89785,0,61962,'Pandaren Ambassador','Hello Traveler!$b$bIt has been a long time since we have seen one so devoted to our local Pandaren factions. You have put in many days of hard work to reach this lofty goal.$b$bTake this token of our appreciation, and know that you are welcome in Pandaria at all times.$b$b--Lorewalker Cho'),
(6846,0,0,83771,0,61962,'Research into the Jinyu','Greetings $n,$b$bI hear you have learned much of the clever Jinyu. Perhaps you should join us at the Seat of Knowledge and share with us this wisdom you have learned.$b$bIncluded should be a map to our location. I look forward to our next meeting.$b$bSincerely,$bLorewalker Cho'),
(6847,0,0,83777,0,61962,'Understanding the Taungol','Greetings $n,$b$bI hear you have been studying the marauding yaungol. There is much more to this hardy race than meets the eye. I would like to share with you some of my own perspectives - please join me at the Seat of Knowledge so that we can talk.$b$bIncluded should be a map to our location. I look forward to our next meeting.$b$bSincerely,$bLorewalker Cho'),
(6855,0,0,83779,0,61962,'The Teachings of Shaohao','Greetings $n,$b$bI have heard that you have walked the path of our last and greatest Emperor Shaohao. This is a subject very dear to me and I have spent many years studying his journey. Please visit us in the Seat of Knowledge so that we may talk!$b$bIncluded should be a map to our location. I look forward to our next meeting.$b$bSincerely,$bLorewalker Cho'),
(6856,0,0,83780,0,61962,'The Adventures of Liu Lang','Greetings $n,$b$bI have heard that you have discovered quite a tale about the wanderer Liu Lang. Perhaps you should join us at the Seat of Knowledge and share with us this wisdom you have learned.$b$bIncluded should be a map to our location. I look forward to our next meeting.$b$bSincerely,$bLorewalker Cho'),
(6857,0,0,83773,0,61962,'Secrets of the Mantid','Greetings $n,$b$bI have heard that you have ventured to uncover the dark secrets of the mantid. Please join me at the Seat of Knowledge and I will help give you some perspective on this unique culture.$b$bIncluded should be a map to our location. I look forward to our next meeting.$b$bSincerely,$bLorewalker Cho'),
(6858,0,0,83774,0,61962,'The Bravery of Heroes Past','Greetings $n,$b$bI understand that you have been studying the history of pandaren fighting and the heroes who forged its techniques. Perhaps you should join us at the Seat of Knowledge so that we can compare what you have learned to the current historical record.$b$bIncluded should be a map to our locat1on. I look forward to our next meeting.$b$bSincerely,$bLorewalker Cho'),
(6874,319,319,0,0,0,NULL,NULL),
(7939,0,0,93228,0,67260,'Brawler`s Pass','You\'ve gathered quite a following down at Brawl\'gar! I\'m kinda curious to see what your friends can do.$b$bHere\'s an invitation to give out. Let\'s get some new blood in here!$b$b- Boss Bazzelflange'),
